# Storyblok access token.
# Locally and on Vercel Preview deployments, use your Storyblok *Preview* token (draft content).
# On Vercel Production, use your Storyblok *Public* token (published content only).
# Set these as separate values scoped per-environment in Vercel: Settings > Environment Variables.
STORYBLOK_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-storyblok-preview-token
